    {"id":"ten-001","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"My cousin ___ to Canada last year to study engineering at a technical college.","correct_answer":"moved","distractors":["has moved","had moved","moves"],"explanation":"عبارة last year تحدد زمنًا منتهيًا فنستخدم الماضي البسيط moved. من الأخطاء الشائعة عند المتعلمين العرب استخدام المضارع التام has moved مع كلمات الزمن المنتهي.","cefr":"B1","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-002","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"Our town ___ a public library since 1985, and it is still one of the busiest in the region.","correct_answer":"has had","distractors":["has","had","had had"],"explanation":"مع since وحالة مستمرة حتى الآن نستخدم المضارع التام has had. لا نقول has a library since 1985 ترجمةً حرفية لـ«لدينا مكتبة منذ…».","cefr":"B1","tags":["cities"]},
    {"id":"ten-003","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"When I was a child, my family ___ to the beach every summer holiday.","correct_answer":"went","distractors":["has gone","had gone","goes"],"explanation":"الجملة تصف عادة متكررة في فترة انتهت (when I was a child)، فنستخدم الماضي البسيط went.","cefr":"B1","tags":["family"]},
    {"id":"ten-004","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"By the time we reached the stadium, the match ___, so we only saw the second half.","correct_answer":"had started","distractors":["has started","starts","will start"],"explanation":"By the time + ماضٍ بسيط يحدد نقطة في الماضي، والمباراة بدأت قبلها، فنستخدم الماضي التام had started للحدث الأسبق.","cefr":"B1","tags":["culture"]},
    {"id":"ten-005","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"I ___ my essay to the teacher two days ago, but she hasn't marked it yet.","correct_answer":"sent","distractors":["have sent","had sent","send"],"explanation":"two days ago زمن منتهٍ محدد فنستخدم sent، أما hasn't marked yet فمضارع تام لأن التصحيح لم يحدث حتى الآن.","cefr":"B1","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-006","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"Traffic in the city centre ___ steadily since the new metro line opened in 2021.","correct_answer":"has fallen","distractors":["fell","is falling","falls"],"explanation":"الجملة الرئيسية التي فيها since + نقطة في الماضي تتطلب المضارع التام، لأن الانخفاض مستمر حتى الآن.","cefr":"B2","tags":["transport"]},
    {"id":"ten-007","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"This is the first time our school ___ a science fair, so the students are very excited.","correct_answer":"has organised","distractors":["organises","organised","had organised"],"explanation":"بعد This is the first time نستخدم المضارع التام. يقول كثير من المتعلمين العرب This is the first time we organise ترجمةً لـ«هذه أول مرة ننظم».","cefr":"B2","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-008","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"Two years ago, the council ___ a new recycling scheme, and since then household waste has dropped by a fifth.","correct_answer":"introduced","distractors":["has introduced","had introduced","introduces"],"explanation":"Two years ago زمن منتهٍ محدد فنستخدم الماضي البسيط introduced، ثم ننتقل إلى المضارع التام مع since then.","cefr":"B2","tags":["environment"]},
    {"id":"ten-009","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"So far this year, the charity ___ three new shelters for homeless families in the city.","correct_answer":"has opened","distractors":["opened","had opened","opens"],"explanation":"So far this year تعني «حتى الآن في هذا العام» والفترة لم تنتهِ، فنستخدم المضارع التام has opened.","cefr":"B2","tags":["cities"]},
    {"id":"ten-010","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"The river's water level ___ its lowest point in 2019 but has risen steadily since then.","correct_answer":"reached","distractors":["has reached","had reached","reaches"],"explanation":"in 2019 سنة محددة منتهية فنستخدم الماضي البسيط reached، وهذا أسلوب أساسي في وصف الرسوم البيانية في Task 1.","cefr":"B2","tags":["environment"]},
    {"id":"ten-011","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"She felt nervous on the first day because she ___ in front of such a large audience before.","correct_answer":"had never spoken","distractors":["has never spoken","never speaks","was never speaking"],"explanation":"الخبرة حتى نقطة في الماضي (she felt nervous … before) يعبَّر عنها بالماضي التام had never spoken.","cefr":"B2","tags":["work"]},
    {"id":"ten-012","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"No sooner ___ the new policy been announced than staff began to complain about it.","correct_answer":"had","distractors":["has","was","did"],"explanation":"التركيب No sooner + had + فاعل + التصريف الثالث … than يعبّر عن حدث وقع مباشرة قبل حدث ماضٍ آخر.","cefr":"C1","tags":["work"]},
    {"id":"ten-013","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"By the end of the nineteenth century, the railway ___ travel times between major cities dramatically.","correct_answer":"had reduced","distractors":["has reduced","reduces","had been reduced"],"explanation":"By + زمن في الماضي (by the end of the nineteenth century) يتطلب الماضي التام لأن التغيير اكتمل قبل تلك النقطة.","cefr":"C1","tags":["transport"]},
    {"id":"ten-014","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"The professor, who ___ at the university since 1998, is retiring at the end of this term.","correct_answer":"has taught","distractors":["taught","had taught","teaches"],"explanation":"بدأ التدريس عام 1998 وما زال مستمرًا (is retiring)، فنستخدم المضارع التام has taught حتى داخل جملة الصلة.","cefr":"C1","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-015","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"Lately, more and more young people ___ an interest in traditional crafts such as pottery and weaving.","correct_answer":"have shown","distractors":["has shown","had shown","were showing"],"explanation":"Lately تعني «في الآونة الأخيرة وحتى الآن» فتأتي مع المضارع التام have shown لا مع الماضي البسيط. ولا يصح has shown لأن الفاعل young people جمع.","cefr":"C1","tags":["culture"]},
    {"id":"ten-016","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"The volunteers ___ on the river clean-up for three hours, and they still have not finished.","correct_answer":"have been working","distractors":["worked","are working","had been working"],"explanation":"عبارة for three hours مع «لم ينتهوا بعد» تعني نشاطًا بدأ في الماضي وما زال مستمرًا، فنستخدم المضارع التام المستمر have been working. أما worked فتوحي بأن العمل انتهى.","cefr":"B2","tags":["environment"]},
    {"id":"ten-017","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"My grandparents ___ a small farm near the mountains, and they have lived there all their lives.","correct_answer":"own","distractors":["are owning","were owning","have been owning"],"explanation":"own فعل حالة (stative) فلا يأتي عادةً بصيغة الاستمرار؛ نقول own لا are owning. العربية تعبّر عن الملكية بالمضارع «يملكون» فيظن المتعلم أن الإنجليزية تقبل الاستمرار.","cefr":"B2","tags":["family"]},
    {"id":"ten-018","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"I will send you a message as soon as the exam results ___ on the school website.","correct_answer":"appear","distractors":["will appear","would appear","appeared"],"explanation":"بعد as soon as نستخدم المضارع البسيط appear حتى لو كان المعنى مستقبليًا، ولا نضع will بعدها. وهو خطأ يشبه وضع will بعد if.","cefr":"B1","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-019","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"By the time she turns thirty, my sister ___ in at least four different countries.","correct_answer":"will have lived","distractors":["will live","has lived","is living"],"explanation":"By the time + مضارع بسيط (turns) يحدد نقطة في المستقبل، وما تراكم قبلها من خبرات يُعبَّر عنه بالمستقبل التام will have lived.","cefr":"C1","tags":["family"]},
    {"id":"ten-020","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"My aunt barely recognised her old neighbourhood because it ___ so much since her last visit.","correct_answer":"had changed","distractors":["has changed","changed","was changing"],"explanation":"الجملة الرئيسية في الماضي (recognised) وsince her last visit تعني أن التغيّر سبق ذلك الوقت، فنستخدم الماضي التام had changed. ولا تصح has changed لأن الزمن الرئيسي ماضٍ.","cefr":"B2","tags":["cities"]},
    {"id":"ten-021","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"In 2018 the minister promised that every primary school ___ free lunches within two years, and the promise was kept.","correct_answer":"would provide","distractors":["provided","provides","has provided"],"explanation":"الوعد صدر في الماضي ونحن ننظر إلى مستقبله من ذلك الوقت، فنستخدم would provide بدل will provide. العربية لا تغيّر زمن الفعل في الكلام المنقول بخلاف الإنجليزية.","cefr":"B2","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-022","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"In her last email, my cousin explained that she ___ medicine at that time, so she could not visit us.","correct_answer":"was studying","distractors":["is studying","studies","has studied"],"explanation":"بعد فعل نقل ماضٍ (explained) نُرجع المضارع المستمر إلى الماضي المستمر was studying، وat that time تؤكد ذلك. يبقي المتعلم العربي الفعل مضارعًا لأن العربية لا تغيّره في الكلام المنقول.","cefr":"B1","tags":["education"]},
    {"id":"ten-023","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"By the time the doctor finally saw him, the patient ___ from severe headaches for almost a month.","correct_answer":"had been suffering","distractors":["suffered","has been suffering","suffers"],"explanation":"By the time + ماضٍ بسيط يحدد نقطة في الماضي، والمعاناة استمرت قبلها لمدة (for almost a month)، فنستخدم الماضي التام المستمر had been suffering.","cefr":"C1","tags":["health"]},
    {"id":"ten-024","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"Water ___ at one hundred degrees Celsius when the air pressure is normal.","correct_answer":"boils","distractors":["is boiling","boiled","has boiled"],"explanation":"هذه حقيقة علمية عامة فنستخدم المضارع البسيط boils، ولا نستخدم المستمر لأن الغليان هنا ليس حدثًا جاريًا الآن.","cefr":"B1","tags":["science"]},
    {"id":"ten-025","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"You seem to know everyone here. How long ___ in this neighbourhood?","correct_answer":"have you lived","distractors":["do you live","did you live","are you living"],"explanation":"السؤال عن مدة ممتدة حتى الآن، فنستخدم المضارع التام How long have you lived. يقول المتعلمون العرب How long do you live ترجمةً لـ«منذ متى تسكن».","cefr":"B1","tags":["cities"]},
    {"id":"ten-026","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"As a child, she never imagined that one day she ___ one of the most respected scientists in her country.","correct_answer":"would become","distractors":["became","becomes","has become"],"explanation":"الجملة تروي أفكار الماضي (never imagined) والمستقبل المقصود يُنظر إليه من ذلك الماضي، فنستخدم would become وليس will become.","cefr":"C1","tags":["science"]},
    {"id":"ten-027","rule":"tenses","sentence_with_gap":"My grandfather, who is ninety now, still ___ for a walk along the river every morning.","correct_answer":"goes","distractors":["is going","went","has gone"],"explanation":"still وevery morning تدلان على عادة مستمرة في الحاضر، فنستخدم المضارع البسيط goes. لا نستخدم المستمر is going مع كلمات التكرار مثل every morning.","cefr":"B1","tags":["family"]}
